OL,3,GNEWSAVillage oil spill revives call for
OL,4,Anew road
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn oil spill that forced the closure of
OL,7,Fa key route through a Norfolk village
OL,8,Fhas sparked renewed calls for a new
OL,9,Froad to solve long-running traffic
OL,10,Fwoes.
OL,12,FFor nearly a fortnight, the B1150
OL,13,FStation Road in Coltishall has been
OL,14,Fshut due to work to clear up the spill.
OL,16,FVillagers said the closure caused a
OL,17,Fhuge amount of disruption and forced
OL,18,Ftraffic on to smaller residential
OL,19,Froads, adding to existing issues.
OL,20,FCampaigners are demanding a solution is
OL,21,Ffound ahead of thousands of planned
OL,22,Fhomes being built in North Walsham.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
